remove all;
units temperature K pressure Pa enthalpy J/mol entropy J/mol/K volume m3/mol 
amounts mol viscosity Pas thcond W/m/K surten N/m diffusion m2/s;
datum enthalpy compound entropy compound; 
set fractions; chardata INFOCHAR TBSOEREIDE; 
puredata Infodata; 
chardata Infochar TbSoereide; 
Components overwrite
1 "CARBON DIOXIDE" ; 
bipdata INFOBIPS OILANDGAS4; 
BipSet PR78BIP 1 constant eos none; 
BipSet LGSTBIP 1 constant eos none; 
model MPR78 PRA PSAT78 LDEN VDW PR78BIP; 
model VSuperTRAPP SPVISC LFIT; 
model TCSuperTRAPP SPTHCOND SPTHCOND; 
model STLGST LGST MPR78 LGSTBIP; 
PD GAS gas MPR78 MPR78 MPR78 VSuperTRAPP TCSuperTRAPP STLGST; 
PD LIQUID1 liquid MPR78 MPR78 MPR78 VSuperTRAPP TCSuperTRAPP STLGST; 
keys LIQUID1 "*"; 
PD LIQUID2 liquid MPR78 MPR78 MPR78 VSuperTRAPP TCSuperTRAPP STLGST; 
keys LIQUID2 "*"; 
PD WATER liquid MPR78 MPR78 MPR78 VSuperTRAPP TCSuperTRAPP STLGST; 
keys WATER AQUEOUS; 
amounts 100.; 
tolamounts 0.; 
Temperature 277; 
Pressure 5000000; 
units temperature K pressure bar enthalpy J/mol entropy J/mol/K volume 
m3/kg density kg/m3 amounts mole viscosity Pas thcond W/m/K surten N/m 
diffusion m2/s GOR sm3/sm3; 
